bug_descriptions |bug_id, line_num, content|
    cuda_runtime_not_cuda_stubs_no_dlopen_2026_11_26, 0, "Split from cuda_gpu_gated_spec_defects_2026-08-09 item 3. src/compiler_rust/runtime/src/cuda_runtime.rs has 41 cfg(not(feature = cuda)) rt_cuda_* exports that return hard 0 or -3 (for example rt_cuda_device_compute_capability returns 0 at line 1603) instead of dispatching through the dlopen driver as the interpreter shims now do, so compiled programs from a non-cuda build see a different CUDA surface than the interpreter. This file is being changed by the rt_cuda_* C-forwarder lane (work/bug-cuda-module-get-function-abi-20261126, work/bug-cuda-launch-ex-*); coordinate ownership before fixing."

